LICENSE NOT YET SELECTED
========================

⚠️  This file is a PLACEHOLDER, not a license.

Do not publish this repository until a license has been selected and its full
text has replaced the contents of this file.

In most jurisdictions a public repository with no license defaults to "all
rights reserved", meaning readers may not legally copy, modify, or redistribute
it. That directly contradicts the paper's data availability statement, which
promises the code is published "for researchers to access, reproduce, and
further develop".

Recommendation and reasoning are in the internal pre-publication review
report held by the project team:

  Code               MIT
  Docs and prompts   CC-BY-4.0

Once selected, REPLACE the entire contents of this file with the full license
text.
